---
manual: slots.window_is_flow
lines: [1621, 1621]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  @left = stack width: 100, height: 30
  @right = stack width: 100, height: 30
end
----------- test code
left = layout_of(stack("@left"))
right = layout_of(stack("@right"))

assert_in_delta left.y, right.y, 0.5, "two slots at the top of the window share a row, as in a flow"
assert_in_delta left.x + 100, right.x, 0.5
